  "Description": [
    "pytest plugin that allows recording of network interactions A pytest plugin that records network interactions in your tests via VCR.py. . Features: . * Straightforward `pytest.mark.vcr`, that reflects `VCR.use_cassettes` API; * Combining multiple VCR cassettes; * Network access blocking; * The ``rewrite`` recording mode that rewrites cassettes from scratch."
